STRINGTABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_MISSION_OBJ_5152                "Astronaut töten"
    IDS_MISSION_OBJ_5153                "Rakete besteigen"
    IDS_MISSION_OBJ_5154                "Diesem Gespräch lauschen"
    IDS_MISSION_OBJ_5155                "Both H.A.R.M. and UNITY have established outposts in the deep desert. Be on the lookout for enemy snipers as you infiltrate the enemy outpost and use the sunglasses gadget to photograph enemy intelligence items."
    IDS_MISSION_OBJ_5156                "A furious battle is being waged in the frozen wastes of the arctic landscape. Infiltrate the enemy outpost and use the sunglasses gadget to photograph enemy intelligence items while protecting those in your possession."
    IDS_MISSION_OBJ_5157                "H.A.R.M. and UNITY are battling for control of a space station. Infiltrate the enemy's position and snap photos of their intelligence items."
    IDS_MISSION_OBJ_5158                "Opposing bases dominate either end of a great wall. Your goal is infiltrate the enemy base to photograph secret intelligence items. Don't forget to protect the documents in your possession!"
    IDS_MISSION_OBJ_5159                "On a dark and stormy night, H.A.R.M. and UNITY forces have simultaneously secured sections of a secret industrial compound in East Berlin. Collect enemy intelligence using the sunglasses while guarding your portion of the compound."
